{"ticker":"RTX","updated":"2026-11-07T01:51:58Z","profile":{"longName":"RTX Corporation","shortName":"RTX Corporation","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","country":"United States","website":"https://www.rtx.com","fullTimeEmployees":180000,"marketCap":255759466496,"trailingPE":30.817886,"forwardPE":23.51985,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.664522,"pegRatio":2.05,"targetMeanPrice":227.91304,"targetHighPrice":250.0,"targetLowPrice":200.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":23,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.111,"earningsGrowth":0.34,"grossMargins":0.21096,"operatingMargins":0.15538,"profitMargins":0.08754,"totalRevenue":95986999296,"beta":0.282,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":226.88,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":166.74,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.52},"summary":"RTX Corporation, an aerospace and defense company, provides systems and services for commercial, military, and government customers worldwide. It operates through three segments: Collins Aerospace (Collins), Pratt & Whitney, and Raytheon. The Collins segment offers aerospace and defense products, and aftermarket services for civil and military aircraft manufacturers and commercial airlines, as well as regional, business, and general aviation, defense, and commercial space operations. This segment designs, manufactures, and supplies electric power generation and management and distribution, environmental control, flight control, air data and aircraft sensing, engine control, and engine nacelle systems, as well as engine components; cabin interiors, including seating, oxygen, food and beverage preparation, storage and galley, lavatory, and wastewater management systems; connected aviation solutions and services; and systems solutions for connected battlespace, test and training range systems, crew escape systems, and simulation and training. It also provides spare parts, overhaul and repair, engineering and technical support, training and fleet management solutions, and asset and information management services. The Pratt & Whitney segment supplies aircraft engines for commercial, military, business jet, and general aviation customers; and produces, sells, and services military a","summary_zh":"RTX Corporation 是一家航空航太和國防公司，為全球商業、軍事和政府客戶提供系統和服務。該公司透過三個部門運作：柯林斯航空航天部門（Collins）、普惠公司和雷神公司。柯林斯部門為民用和軍用飛機製造商和商業航空公司以及支線、商業和通用航空、國防和商業航天運營提供航空航天和國防產品以及售後服務。該部門設計、製造和供應發電、管理和配電、環境控制、飛行控制、空氣數據和廚房感測、發動機控制、發動機短艙系統以及發動機部件；客艙內部，包括座椅、氧氣、食品和飲料準備、儲藏室和廚房、衛生間和廢水管理系統；互聯航空解決方案和服務；以及用於互聯戰場空間、乘測試和訓練目標系統、乘測試和訓練系統的解決方案和服務空間；它還提供備件、大修和維修、工程和技術支援、培訓和車隊管理解決方案以及資產和資訊管理服務。普惠公司部門為商用、軍用、公務機和通用航空客戶提供飛機發動機；生產、銷售和服務軍用產品","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"航空航太與國防","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":156.92,"h":157.0,"l":153.66,"c":154.22,"v":5522800},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":153.64,"h":153.7,"l":150.61,"c":151.75,"v":5461300},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":152.0,"h":155.04,"l":151.65,"c":155.0,"v":4520400},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":155.03,"h":158.01,"l":154.36,"c":157.65,"v":4289900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":157.75,"h":158.14,"l":155.82,"c":155.85,"v":3194400},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":155.93,"h":158.48,"l":155.71,"c":158.37,"v":3891400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":159.85,"h":159.95,"l":157.64,"c":158.58,"v":6525200},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":158.57,"h":159.32,"l":157.62,"c":158.31,"v":3999200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":157.31,"h":158.29,"l":156.5,"c":158.19,"v":3696100},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":158.7,"h":158.7,"l":156.69,"c":158.24,"v":7083700},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":158.07,"h":159.8,"l":157.67,"c":159.43,"v":3296700},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":159.75,"h":161.4,"l":158.95,"c":160.54,"v":3287100},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":161.15,"h":163.03,"l":160.7,"c":161.38,"v":4269800},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":162.14,"h":162.3,"l":159.69,"c":160.51,"v":3917700},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":162.0,"h":165.35,"l":161.69,"c":163.35,"v":3961700},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":167.43,"h":168.28,"l":162.79,"c":163.63,"v":6216100},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":164.29,"h":167.5,"l":163.87,"c":167.33,"v":4893700},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":165.87,"h":167.72,"l":165.08,"c":167.2,"